  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till justitieministeriet f&#xf6;r kompetensutveckling av domare, &#xe5;kla-gare, advokater m fl personal inom r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sendet, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade rutiner vid domstolarna vad g&#xe4;ller dagbok, beslut, ansvarsf&#xf6;rdelning mm samt f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;k att inf&#xf6;ra r&#xe4;tteg&#xe5;ngsprocedur efter s k kontradiktorisk princip, dvs b&#xe4;ttre balans mellan domare, &#xe5;klagare och advokat4.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Ministry of Justice for strengthening of competence among judges, lawyers, prosecutors and other staff within the judi- cial system; improved routines at the courts for keeping diary, takingand filing decisions, division of responsibilities etc; and efforts tointroduce the contradictory trial principle in the courts.</narrative>
  </description>
